WEBVTT

00:46:26.996 --> 00:46:33.788
And even though it's actually not sad,
like it's actually not sad to me now.

00:46:34.746 --> 00:46:38.621
It's a memory of sadness that
I that I reinhabited,

00:46:38.913 --> 00:46:40.538
this was really made a life to me.

00:46:41.413 --> 00:46:44.038
I was on the set a lot when
we were making the movie.

00:46:44.496 --> 00:46:47.538
So I was there like every day and, you
know, really involved in everything.

00:46:47.538 --> 00:46:51.329
And there's this scene in the movie
and in the book where me

00:46:51.329 --> 00:46:54.454
and my ex-husband, we've just
mailed off, you know,

00:46:54.454 --> 00:46:56.704
our divorce papers and we're
standing on the street

00:46:57.121 --> 00:47:00.329
and we're talking to each other
and crying and embracing for